# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Only VITE_-prefixed vars reach the browser,
# so never put private API keys here — keep secrets server-side.

# Optional contact-form submission endpoint. When set, the contact form POSTs
# form data as JSON to this URL; when unset, the form runs in demo mode (no
# data leaves the browser). Works with Formspree, Web3Forms, or your own
# serverless function (e.g. /api/contact). The receiving endpoint must
# re-validate every field and apply rate limiting / spam protection.
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-id
